Analog multiplexers and power switches for IHP sg13cmos5l

Warning:  The first version of the power switch using the waffle layout
of the pMOS has an *inverted* enable.  The second version has a
non-inverted enable.  Since the original version taped out on the first
IHP sg13cmos5l shuttle run, the signal has been renamed from "enable"
to "nenable" to make clear that it is sense negative.
